==Icelandic==
{{Fallbeyging hk sb 01 ö|forn|fn}}
===Etymology===
From ''[[for]]'' meaning "[[pro]]" or "[[before]]" + ''[[nafn]]'' meaning "[[name]]". In total it means "before a name" or "in front of a name".
===Noun===
'''fornafn''' {{n}}

# [[first name]] (i.e. [[given name]])
# (''grammar'') [[pronoun]]

